---
// Before & After Redesign Comparison Slider
---

<section id="redesign" class="pf-section" style="padding-top: 20px;">
  <div class="wrap pf-bawrap">
    <div class="txt pf-rv">
      <span class="pf-tag">Redesign spotlight</span>
      <h2>Website Redesign Example: Before and After</h2>
      <p>
        Most of our projects start with a site that's slow, hard to use on a phone, and invisible on Google. Here's one of them, before and after our team rebuilt it.
      </p>
      
      <div class="pf-deltas">
        <div>
          <span>Mobile load time</span>
          <b><i class="pf-fill">6.8s → 1.4s</i></b>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>Google PageSpeed (mobile)</span>
          <b><i class="pf-fill">31 → 96</i></b>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>Enquiries per month</span>
          <b><i class="pf-fill">12 → 41</i></b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pf-ba pf-rv" style="--d:1" id="ba">
      <!-- BEFORE VIEW: Dated 2010s Layout -->
      <div class="lay before">
        <span class="lbl">Before</span>
        <div class="pf-old">
          <div class="ohead">
            <b>WELCOME !!!</b>
            <span>Call: 0000 000 000 | Email us</span>
          </div>
          <div class="omenu">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
          </div>
          <div class="omar">
            ★ Special offer!!! ★ Click here for latest updates ★ Best services in town ★
          </div>
          <div class="oban">
            BANNER IMAGE (UNOPTIMIZED 4.8MB)
          </div>
          <div class="ocols">
            <div><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          </div>
          <span class="obtn">Click Here</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- AFTER VIEW: High-Converting Modern Teknoppy Redesign -->
      <div class="lay after">
        <span class="lbl">After</span>
        <div class="pf-new">
          <div class="nhead">
            <b>Teknoppy<em>.</em></b>
            <i></i><i></i><i></i>
            <span>Book now</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nhero">
            <div>
              <h4>Clear headline, <em>one clear action.</em></h4>
              <p>Short, specific copy that immediately answers what the visitor came to find.</p>
              <div class="nb">
                <i></i><i></i>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="thumb-box">
              <img src="/portfolios/website/general-tech-services.webp" alt="Modern redesign screenshot" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ncards">
            <div><b></b><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div><b></b><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div><b></b><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          </div>
          <div class="nstrip">
            Rated 4.9 on Google
            <span>Call now</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Interactive Slider Control -->
      <input 
        type="range" 
        min="0" 
        max="100" 
        value="50" 
        id="baIn" 
        aria-label="Drag to compare website before and after redesign"
      />
      <div class="handle">
        <span class="knob">⟷</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
